sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant A as ARTryOnScene<br/>ArTryOnFlowController
  participant T as ArFaceTrackingController
  participant K as AR Foundation<br/>ARCore
  participant M as ArFaceMakeup<br/>+ shaders
  participant O as FallbackMakeupOverlay
  U->>A: open (from result, recommendation, picker)
  A->>A: product shades + ShadeAdvisor shades for skin tone
  A->>T: Run()
  T->>T: camera permission (asked after 0.4 s), crash mark check
  T->>K: CheckAvailability, start session, front camera
  alt live tracking works
    K-->>T: face mesh every frame
    T->>M: mesh + area, shade, strength, finish
    M-->>U: tinted face in camera box
  else any check fails
    T->>O: guided preview with face outline
    O-->>U: colour shapes over camera picture
  end
  Note over T,M: Frames stay in memory. No face image is saved or sent.
